  N=2: |program| = 14   minimal DFA states =  14
  N=3: |program| = 17   minimal DFA states =  34
  N=4: |program| = 20   minimal DFA states =  82
PASS  the family certifies exponential-in-N succinctness on measured minima   | program grows ~5N+lin, DFA grows ~(N+1)2^N — the definition holds with room to spare
PASS  note the quantifiers: one family, but MINIMAL opponents   | dfa_minimize makes the right-hand side a true lower bound, not a lazy construction
```

