PASS  every conversion stayed under a fixed quadratic bound   | max |T|/(|phi|^2+1) = 8.5 — g-bounded expansion, witnessed by a running compiler
PASS  Def. 2 and Def. 3 together will make 'exponentially more succinct' TIGHT   | poly one way (unit 16) + exp the other way (unit 15) = the gap is real, not an artifact
```

